gore_stencil[0] | 6, 6, 32, 32 | Gore shape 1 of 8. It cuts the shape of the body's legs, arms, head, torso and any add-ons drawn above the head (BELOW_HEAD: false) when a subject is reduced to gore. One subject always uses the same number here and in gore_overlay.
